  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "this is definitly a abused system that violates groups rights to moderate there group world and prevents them from seeing if anyone is breaking guidelines because they cant see people if they are teleported to the ban area and are not able to return. \n\nI got teleported in my own group: green eyes in the furry talk and chill world wasnt even breaking any rules, and was only able to rejoin using my other account and to kick everyone out of the instance because i wasnt able to monitor the world myself being the owner of the group. i banned the owner of the furry talk and chill from my group because of that issue im tired of the abuse. fix it please.\n\nthis should include and indicate of any rules that violate or supersede group guideline rules meaning you cant make rules that go agaisnt groups that moderate their instances for example talking about the furry hideout and there \"Rule 15: staff kicked from group instances without reason will cause you to be removed from the world\". \n\nif i were the world owner i would not put that as a rule because i would end up being banned from the group. wouldnt matter if i sent them to the ban area they would still be able to remove me from the instance.",
